---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Mitchell Haw | SEO & AI Search Consultant"
  description="Contact Mitchell Haw for SEO consulting, AI search visibility, local SEO, technical SEO, content strategy, website migrations, and organic search growth help."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="section-label">Contact</p>

        <h1>
          Let’s talk about how your business shows up in search.
        </h1>

        <p>
          Reach out if you need help with SEO, AI search visibility, local search,
          content strategy, technical SEO, website migrations, or improving how your
          business gets found online.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc8-OP6SW3D1AjAc0HUYMB5bq5DySUd0B76N4_lUFI_twafJw/viewform?usp=publish-editor"
          class="primary-btn"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Contact Me
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>What to include in your message</h2>

        <p>
          You do not need to have everything figured out before reaching out. A short note
          with your website, business type, location, and what you are trying to improve is
          enough to get started.
        </p>

        <p>
          It also helps to mention whether you are mainly looking for more local visibility,
          better rankings, more qualified leads, improved website structure, stronger content,
          help with a migration, or a better understanding of how your business appears in
          AI-powered search tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Google AI Overviews.
        </p>

        <h2>Areas I can help with</h2>

        <p>
          I work with businesses that want clearer search strategy and stronger visibility
          across Google, local search, AI search platforms, content surfaces, and the broader web.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>SEO strategy and organic growth planning</li>
          <li>AI search visibility and generative search strategy</li>
          <li>Local SEO and Google Business Profile guidance</li>
          <li>Technical SEO audits and recommendations</li>
          <li>Website migrations and SEO transition planning</li>
          <li>Service page and location page strategy</li>
          <li>Site structure and internal linking improvements</li>
          <li>Content strategy and search intent planning</li>
          <li>Analytics, reporting, and visibility reviews</li>
          <li>Video and YouTube search strategy</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Good fit for local and growing businesses</h2>

        <p>
          I often help local service businesses, tourism and hospitality companies, ecommerce
          brands, professional service firms, multi-location businesses, and teams that need
          practical search guidance without turning everything into a massive project.
        </p>

        <p>
          If your business is in Bend, Redmond, Sisters, Sunriver, or elsewhere in Central
          Oregon, I can help think through local search opportunities with that market in mind.
          I also work with businesses outside the area that need SEO, AI search, or organic
          visibility support.
        </p>

        <h2>What happens next</h2>

        <p>
          After you send the form, I can review what you shared and get a better sense of where
          the biggest opportunities may be. That might be local SEO, technical cleanup, better
          service pages, content gaps, AI search visibility, reporting, or a mix of several areas.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is to figure out what will actually help your business become easier to find,
          easier to understand, and more likely to earn the right traffic, leads, bookings, or sales.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a
            href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc8-OP6SW3D1AjAc0HUYMB5bq5DySUd0B76N4_lUFI_twafJw/viewform?usp=publish-editor"
            class="primary-btn"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Fill Out the Contact Form
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
